  "caption": "A tan surface fills the upper frame, crossed by a narrow vertical specular streak. A white sheet of paper enters from below, its top edge rising while a curved rainbow-colored band appears on it. The streak drifts leftward across the background as the paper moves upward.\n\nThe colored band forms a shallow V near the paper's upper edge, with blue-white and yellow tones spreading downward. As the sheet rises, the band remains anchored to the paper rather than the tan background, shifting only slightly with the framing. A thumb appears at the lower-left corner of the paper, holding it in place while the top edge continues its slow upward movement. The vertical specular streak on the background keeps slowly drifting leftward, meeting the paper's upper boundary in later frames. The rainbow pattern brightens as more of the white surface enters view, then holds its curved shape. The final frames show the paper occupying much of the lower frame, the thumb still visible, and the colored band resting near its top edge.",
